# Web3Forms access key for the Contact form.
# Get one free at https://web3forms.com — enter your inbox address, the key arrives by email.
# Copy this file to `.env` for local dev. For the deployed site, set the same value as a
# GitHub Actions secret named WEB3FORMS_KEY (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions).
#
# Note: this key ships inside the public JS bundle — that is by design for Web3Forms.
# It only allows submitting to your inbox, and can be rotated from the dashboard link
# in your key email if it ever gets abused.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
